            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A ring formation reaction where an alkene reacts with a dihalomethane in the presence of a metal atom or metal complexes to form a cyclopropane. The traditional reaction uses a zinc-copper couple and diiodomethane.</obo:IAO_0000115>
