            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A ring-forming reaction between two equivalents of a beta-ketoester, an aldehyde and ammonia (or an ammonium salt), to give a dihydropyridine. The dihydropyridine can be oxidised to a pyridine using an oxidising agent.</obo:IAO_0000115>
