            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cleaving reaction where an olefin is dihydroxylated with osmium tetroxide and undergoes a Malaprade reaction to yield two aldehydes, two ketones, or an aldehyde and a ketone.</obo:IAO_0000115>
